'''Beefcake Cat''' (ネコマッチョ Neko Maccho, '''Cat Macho''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

