|latest appearance = [[Infernal Tower/Floor 29|Infernal Tower - Floor 29]]
|money drop = 8,888¢ - 35,107¢
}}

==Enemy==
Yet another entry in the "powerful and fast enemy" category, Beefcake Cat is a force to be reckoned with at the best of times, having massive health with fast and deadly Area Attacks to bust past your Cats despite the somewhat mediocre range.

==Strategy==
The easiest way to kill a Beefcake Cat is by using long-ranged attackers such as [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Radiant Aphrodite]] and [[Windy (Uber Rare Cat)|Windy]], and if you have a [[:Category:Cats with Slow ability|slow]] or [[:Category:Cats with Freeze ability|freeze]] unit that affects Floating, use them unless they get outranged.

